                <pb facs="0498" n="464" sameAs="frus:frus1948v02/pg464"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>At a meeting of the United States, United Kingdom, and French Military Governors
                    for Germany at Frankfurt, November 4, General Koenig expressed his
                    dissatisfaction over the plans for international trusteeship for the Ruhr. For
                    records of the meeting, see the notes prepared by Ambassador Murphy and telegram
                    2686, November 5, from Berlin, <ref target="#pg434">pages 434</ref> and <ref
                        target="#pg438">438</ref>.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
